              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Ngabona wonke u-Israyeli ehlakazekile ezintabeni njengezimvu ezingenamalusi; uJehova wathi: “Abanankosi; khona-ke mababuyele, kube yilowo nalowo endlini yakhe ngokuthula.",
